# Text is stored and checked out with LF, whatever the platform, so a Windows
# clone does not rewrite every line ending the first time git touches a file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted — that corrupts them.
# Listed after the blanket rule above, so this wins for these types.
*.pdf -text binary
*.png -text binary
*.jpg -text binary

*.csv text eol=lf
